  "source_receipt_status": "At the time of this V1 receipt, the producer reported exact finite-model checks while the broader programme remained IN_PROGRESS. Producer/root recorded checks are source claims, not dispatcher scientific validation. This receipt records the initial N443-review status; the later V2/reviews receipt below supersedes it with a completed internal analytical audit. Capital verified captured-source hashes and selected-copy readback only; no scientific scripts, checkers or suites were executed.",
